div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">3.</b>  <i>belonging to a</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ῥήτωρ, δοῦλος</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Stud.Pal.</i> 1.67.289</span></span> <span class=\"lsj-date\">(i A.D.)</span>.</div>"}, "r(h/twr": {"key": "r(h/twr", "head": "ῥήτωρ", "html": "<b class=\"lsj-head\">ῥήτωρ</b>, <span class=\"lsj-itype\">ορος</span>, <span class=\"lsj-gen\">ὁ</span>, also <span class=\"lsj-gen\">ἡ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ar.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Fr.</i> 945</span> (cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Th.</i> 292</span>): (<span class=\"lsj-etym\">ἐρῶ</span>):—<div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>public speaker,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">μύθων ῥήτορες</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">E.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Hec.</i> 124</span></span> (anap.), cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Fr.</i> 597.4</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Isoc.</span> 8.129</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Top.</i> 149b25</span>, <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 2.272S., <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Sanit.</i> 2.131a</span>, etc.; esp. at Athens, <span class=\"lsj-greek\">οἱ ῥήτορες</span> the <i>public speakers in the <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἐκκλησία,</span></i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ar.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ach.</i> 38</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">680</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Eq.</i> 60</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">358</span>, al., <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Th.</span> 8.1</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">And.</span> 3.1</span>, <span class=\"lsj